79541", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197914147", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088189942", "personaname": "Maëlle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/flsm2/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 270, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 270, "last_played": 1750627296, "avatar": "e132a7c30a818b31078a230464f2a678a2bb5db5"}, "language": "english", "review": "I heard that this game was \"A mix between warframe and destiny 2\"\nNow I don't know about destiny cause I haven't played it, but every aspect that could ressemble warframe has had its fun leeched away\nNothing feels good or satisfying, gunplay is mid at best and with no movement options whatsoever, it's basically the sole gameplay. Characters abilities have no feedback at all and feel underwhelming, can't say guns really do either. Game spams you with a thousand red exclamation marks after every mission which is really annoying. Honestly TLDR from my experience is it has every warframe's prominent flaws, except it has none of its qualities to compensate. Also I didn't dig very deep into that, but how the game handles premium currency and ingame purchase looks really ♥♥♥♥♥♥. Just don't bother your time most likely deserves better", "timestamp_created": 1750627593, "timestamp_updated": 1750627674, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497925341129302979", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197912546", "author": {"steamid": "76561198147854442", "personaname": "chudo", "persona_status": "offline", "pro